<title>USA: Rowe Furniture Q3 shr $0.14 vs $0.07.</title>
<headline>Rowe Furniture Q3 shr $0.14 vs $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,907		    1,014</p>
<p> Net shipments	   34,768		   29,533</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,358		   13,569</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net			  4,070		    5,758</p>
<p> Net shipments	  104,641		   88,633</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,409		   13,639</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Rowe Furniture Corp.</p>
<p>Third quarter 1996 ended September 4. Third quarter 1995 August 27.</p>
<p>1995's nine month net income and earnings per share include an after-tax restructuring charge of $265,000 or $0.02 per share, and an after-tax gain of about $3.0 million or $0.22 per share from sale of investment property.</p>
